RV32I Level 1 basic-instruction test
====================================

Memory image: tb/basic_instructions_test.hex
Each line is one 32-bit instruction word, beginning at byte address 0.
Unused memory after the last instruction can be filled with NOPs by the testbench.

The program verifies each result using BNE checks. Any failed check branches to
the FAIL handler, which stores 0x000000EE at data-memory byte address 0x100.
If all checks pass, it stores 0x00000055 at byte address 0x100.
Since RAM is word-addressed internally, this result is dmem[64].

Expected final result:
  dmem[64] = 0x00000055 : all instruction checks passed
  dmem[64] = 0x000000EE : at least one instruction check failed

Coverage:
  Register arithmetic: ADD, SUB
  Register logical:    AND, OR, XOR
  Immediate arithmetic/logical: ADDI (positive and negative), ANDI, ORI, XORI
  Shifts: SLLI, SRLI, SRAI, SLL, SRL, SRA
  Comparisons: SLT, SLTU, SLTI, SLTIU
  Upper immediate: LUI and AUIPC

Address    Machine code  Instruction / check
--------   ------------  --------------------
00000000   01400093      addi x1,x0,20           ; x1 = 20
00000004   00600113      addi x2,x0,6            ; x2 = 6
00000008   002081b3      add x3,x1,x2            ; x3 = 26
0000000c   01a00213      addi x4,x0,26
00000010   12419063      bne x3,x4,fail          ; verify ADD
00000014   402081b3      sub x3,x1,x2            ; x3 = 14
00000018   00e00213      addi x4,x0,14
0000001c   10419a63      bne x3,x4,fail          ; verify SUB
00000020   0020f1b3      and x3,x1,x2            ; x3 = 4
00000024   00400213      addi x4,x0,4
00000028   10419463      bne x3,x4,fail          ; verify AND
0000002c   0020e1b3      or x3,x1,x2             ; x3 = 22
00000030   01600213      addi x4,x0,22
00000034   0e419e63      bne x3,x4,fail          ; verify OR
00000038   0020c1b3      xor x3,x1,x2            ; x3 = 18
0000003c   01200213      addi x4,x0,18
00000040   0e419863      bne x3,x4,fail          ; verify XOR
00000044   ffb08193      addi x3,x1,-5           ; signed immediate, x3 = 15
00000048   00f00213      addi x4,x0,15
0000004c   0e419263      bne x3,x4,fail          ; verify ADDI/sign extension
00000050   0070f193      andi x3,x1,7            ; x3 = 4
00000054   00400213      addi x4,x0,4
00000058   0c419c63      bne x3,x4,fail          ; verify ANDI
0000005c   01016193      ori x3,x2,16            ; x3 = 22
00000060   01600213      addi x4,x0,22
00000064   0c419663      bne x3,x4,fail          ; verify ORI
00000068   01f0c193      xori x3,x1,31           ; x3 = 11
0000006c   00b00213      addi x4,x0,11
00000070   0c419063      bne x3,x4,fail          ; verify XORI
00000074   00211193      slli x3,x2,2            ; x3 = 24
00000078   01800213      addi x4,x0,24
0000007c   0a419a63      bne x3,x4,fail          ; verify SLLI
00000080   0020d193      srli x3,x1,2            ; x3 = 5
00000084   00500213      addi x4,x0,5
00000088   0a419463      bne x3,x4,fail          ; verify SRLI
0000008c   fe000093      addi x1,x0,-32          ; x1 = 0xffffffe0
00000090   4020d193      srai x3,x1,2            ; arithmetic shift; x3 = -8
00000094   ff800213      addi x4,x0,-8
00000098   08419c63      bne x3,x4,fail          ; verify SRAI/sign fill
0000009c   00200293      addi x5,x0,2            ; register shift amount
000000a0   01400093      addi x1,x0,20           ; restore x1
000000a4   005111b3      sll x3,x2,x5            ; x3 = 24
000000a8   01800213      addi x4,x0,24
000000ac   08419263      bne x3,x4,fail          ; verify SLL
000000b0   0050d1b3      srl x3,x1,x5            ; x3 = 5
000000b4   00500213      addi x4,x0,5
000000b8   06419c63      bne x3,x4,fail          ; verify SRL
000000bc   fe000093      addi x1,x0,-32
000000c0   4050d1b3      sra x3,x1,x5            ; arithmetic shift; x3 = -8
000000c4   ff800213      addi x4,x0,-8
000000c8   06419463      bne x3,x4,fail          ; verify SRA
000000cc   0020a1b3      slt x3,x1,x2            ; signed -32 < 6; x3 = 1
000000d0   00100213      addi x4,x0,1
000000d4   04419e63      bne x3,x4,fail          ; verify SLT
000000d8   0020b1b3      sltu x3,x1,x2           ; unsigned 0xffffffe0 < 6 is false
000000dc   00000213      addi x4,x0,0
000000e0   04419863      bne x3,x4,fail          ; verify SLTU
000000e4   0000a193      slti x3,x1,0            ; signed -32 < 0; x3 = 1
000000e8   00100213      addi x4,x0,1
000000ec   04419263      bne x3,x4,fail          ; verify SLTI
000000f0   0010b193      sltiu x3,x1,1           ; unsigned 0xffffffe0 < 1 is false
000000f4   00000213      addi x4,x0,0
000000f8   02419c63      bne x3,x4,fail          ; verify SLTIU
000000fc   123450b7      lui x1,0x12345           ; x1 = 0x12345000
00000100   12300113      addi x2,x0,0x123         ; independently build expected constant
00000104   00c11113      slli x2,x2,12
00000108   45010113      addi x2,x2,0x450
0000010c   00811113      slli x2,x2,8             ; x2 = 0x12345000
00000110   02209063      bne x1,x2,fail           ; verify LUI
00000114   00000097      auipc x1,0               ; x1 = current PC = 0x114
00000118   11400113      addi x2,x0,0x114         ; expected PC value
0000011c   00209a63      bne x1,x2,fail           ; verify AUIPC
00000120   10000513      addi x10,x0,256          ; signature RAM byte address
00000124   05500593      addi x11,x0,0x55         ; PASS signature
00000128   00b52023      sw x11,0(x10)            ; dmem[64] = PASS
0000012c   00c0006f      jal x0,done              ; skip FAIL handler
00000130   0ee00593      addi x11,x0,0xEE         ; FAIL signature
00000134   00b52023      sw x11,0(x10)            ; dmem[64] = FAIL
00000138   0000006f      jal x0,done              ; park forever

The branch instructions target the FAIL handler at 0x130. The success path
stores its signature at byte address 0x100 (word index 64) and jumps to 0x138.
